{"chunks": ["EdNova demo source: Relational Database Design & Normalization\n\nFirst Normal Form (1NF) requires every attribute value to be atomic: a column\nmust not hold repeating groups or comma-separated lists. A relation such as\nStudent(StudentID, FullName, CourseCodes[Array]) violates 1NF because CourseCodes\nstores several values in one attribute.\n\nSecond Normal Form (2NF) removes partial dependencies on part of a composite\nprimary key. A relation is in 2NF when it is in 1NF and every non-key attribute\ndepends on the whole key."], "contentHash": "sha256:c197e3f175733ca3eff51a4471bea1578dc69a7ebe85b503fb53bd44016192d0", "courseId": "977dcbd7-ddb7-4aad-8724-a13b2ed06691", "documents": [{"contentHash": "sha256:c197e3f175733ca3eff51a4471bea1578dc69a7ebe85b503fb53bd44016192d0", "documentId": "doc_c197e3f175733ca3", "filename": "relational-normalization.txt", "mediaType": "text/plain", "provenance": "extracted", "storageRef": "originals/c197e3f175733ca3eff51a4471bea1578dc69a7ebe85b503fb53bd44016192d0"}], "indexHash": "sha256:0632cab2dd16850e6c8a7f9cd190887f281329f4c2c1a2296e90de86eceded6d", "manifestDigest": "sha256:ea52d12621b80b79589a64a038eaf4e7550f202ff93a98145e8fdb244c50c6b7", "metas": [{"chunk_id": "chk_1d7c3f2d22c7f407f7d0420c4ae09be1f6cef3b89dad6b5239d1d0c98838b8f3", "content_hash": "sha256:c197e3f175733ca3eff51a4471bea1578dc69a7ebe85b503fb53bd44016192d0", "course_id": "977dcbd7-ddb7-4aad-8724-a13b2ed06691", "document_id": "doc_c197e3f175733ca3", "extraction_method": "text", "extraction_warning": null, "ocr_confidence": null, "page_number": null, "provenance": "extracted", "review_required": false, "revision_id": "rev_20261018_v1", "section_id": "section_1", "text_hash": "sha256:1d7c3f2d22c7f407f7d0420c4ae09be1f6cef3b89dad6b5239d1d0c98838b8f3"}], "revisionId": "rev_20261018_v1", "schemaVersion": "1.0.0"}